## EduGenie: Google Gemini Powered Learning Assistant — Project Planning

 ### 1\. Project Planning Overview

 **EduGenie** is planned as an AI-powered learning platform that uses **Google Gemini** to provide personalized educational assistance. The project will be developed in stages, starting with requirements and design and progressing through implementation, testing, deployment, and documentation.

 ### 2\. Project Goals

 - Build an easy-to-use AI learning assistant.
- Integrate Google Gemini for intelligent responses.
- Provide personalized explanations for academic topics.
- Generate summaries, quizzes, and revision materials.
- Maintain student learning history and progress.
- Develop a secure and scalable application.
- Evaluate the system for usability and response quality.

 ### 3\. Project Scope

 #### In Scope

 - Student registration and login.
- AI-powered educational chatbot.
- Subject/topic-based questions.
- Concept explanations.
- Study-material summarization.
- AI-generated quizzes.
- Quiz evaluation and scoring.
- Learning history.
- Student progress dashboard.
- Gemini API integration.

 #### Out of Scope for Initial Version

 - Live classes.
- Direct teacher-student video communication.
- Fully automated grading of university examinations.
- Official academic certification.
- Replacement of teachers or institutional learning systems.

 ### 4\. Development Methodology

 The project can follow an **Agile development approach**.

 Development will be divided into small iterations. Each iteration will produce a functional part of EduGenie, allowing testing and improvements before moving to the next stage.

```
Requirement Analysis
        ↓
System Design
        ↓
UI/UX Design
        ↓
Database & Backend Setup
        ↓
Gemini API Integration
        ↓
Feature Development
        ↓
Testing
        ↓
Deployment
        ↓
Documentation & Presentation
```

