 ### 10\. Risk Management

 | Risk | Impact | Mitigation |
| --- | --- | --- |
| Gemini API unavailable | High | Implement error handling and fallback messages |
| API usage limits | Medium | Monitor usage and optimize requests |
| Incorrect AI responses | High | Add validation, clear prompts, and user guidance |
| Data loss | High | Regular database backups |
| Security vulnerabilities | High | Secure authentication and protect API credentials |
| Development delays | Medium | Use weekly milestones |
| Integration problems | Medium | Test each module before integration |
| Poor user experience | Medium | Conduct usability testing with sample users |

