 ### 13\. Success Criteria

 The project will be considered successfully completed when:

 - Users can register and securely access the application.
- Students can ask educational questions through the AI assistant.
- Gemini can generate relevant educational responses.
- Students can generate summaries and quizzes.
- Quiz answers can be evaluated automatically.
- Learning activities can be stored and displayed.
- The major modules work together without critical errors.
- The application meets the defined functional requirements.

 ### 14\. Final Project Outcome

 At the end of the project, **EduGenie** will be delivered as a functional AI-powered learning assistant capable of combining **conversational learning, personalized explanations, automated study-material generation, quizzes, and progress tracking** in one platform.

 The project plan is structured so that the **core MVP can be completed first**, while advanced features such as voice interaction, multilingual support, image-based questions, and advanced analytics can be added later.
